{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_018_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ff9faaf10c99704628f8954ef42be86fc9506ded273e0e5eeaf3f19f9e92d26f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:315c376d0448fdb0b227d2854a9926531fc62e3be9f7de25a6d52f48060e7ac1",
      "text": "工作辛苦啦。\n●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a43e3fc0407d106aa1940a5527eab4174d8fb4af05f1b76b26990add64323bdb",
      "text": "百忙之中打扰真是不好意思，\n能稍微借人家一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55e9a2dca21aceead7dbc80672bae3b6c9821a7eb81ef86421a60cba30fd42d1",
      "text": "毕竟是白色情人节嘛。\n人家给你准备了礼物哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42502f738162f7d7f81b892210dff0337f6dc6832b5dbe359de44cb418a78487",
      "text": "要决定选哪样可费了人家好一番工夫呢♪\n愿意收下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13cab1d8ce15463ee75d116532115d05030ef503c5f1f77012526c253094ac84",
      "text": "选了感觉能让你打起精神的东西哦。\n要是能合你心意，人家也会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f122b6ee3adfa6a63d99bdc746d4005a745cf855e12e6966b4a64b625ab99eda",
      "text": "特地把你叫到这么冷的地方来，真对不住呢。\n夜晚果然还是有点凉飕飕的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69e1ef10ae7bed61d1d9823f7c9b01eae5f45d539dc733ddc3c05947111942f1",
      "text": "不过，人家觉得这种事地点也是很重要的。\n至少我是这么想的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96584f565d234d44a06e6e9fad2df6d95d2c53c483c25281a1a698bd8593a7ac",
      "text": "呵呵，你看，今天是白色情人节对吧。\n这是送给你的礼物哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_b:cmd-000034:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b10c343f4c6771318030e4937d35a46c59ee18a9c404797912e661c4a5aa329",
      "text": "非常感谢！我会好好珍惜的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_b:cmd-000035:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b287dd7e6b0f94d85ada8a09232fb9bb77c731cdad5b75c0b111f25e36701a54",
      "text": "原来是因为这个啊！好开心",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33f8f84f4468d4c51fbdd2a0c86ce17f3ba126f346b83d2c2f23975e04a81172",
      "text": "给制作人酱送礼物，\n让人觉得很有意义，我也很舒畅呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffcc7d871700ae6cf783a4b9ab83c2b511a7f3db5f86b35970f66d8bc4d19780",
      "text": "哎呀，原来你之前完全没察觉到吗？\n这倒成了个小小的惊喜呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdf208847ce23ea0d1c83848dfb88914bc7a0acce550a924e92d1dca731ad02b",
      "text": "里面的东西是我一边想象着你开心的模样，\n一边反复推敲思量才挑出来的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3575a9368c9f74ca4222ebfbf929ef5ff5b6236eedf684f66c0078f895855219",
      "text": "想必你在情人节的时候，\n也是怀着同样的心情挑礼物的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb44e36a5e504121f57c1eaa79a308d67ba436ddf405a7643d9251957fae785e",
      "text": "就算嘴上不说，\n尝过巧克力之后我也全都感受到了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_22:5_02_018_22_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d20ef432e395321d3df8455b92b5c7337f80b7a805a9a464de1cc6d3d27076d0",
      "text": "……好啦。差不多也该回事务所了吧。\n人家给你泡杯热茶喝吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
